Dear fellow Battlemesh enthusiasts,

The Wireless Battle of the Mesh v11 (#WBMv11) and the Wireless Community=20
Weekend 2018 (#FFWCW18) will be meshed up and co-located in Berlin from May=
 07=20
to May 13, 2018.
Since it is the 15th anniversary of the WCW, friends and fellows from acros=
s=20
the globe celebrate together wireless mesh network technologies and ideas o=
f=20
community networking.

You can expect to meet with tech experts in mesh technologies, policy=20
discussions, talks, hands on workshops, late night hacking sessions,=20
measurement campaigns and an ongoing barbeque at the riverside. If you are =
a=20
mesh networking enthusiast, community activist, or simply have an interest =
in=20
wifi or dynamic routing protocols, you can't miss this event!
So check out our continuously updated information about the event at https:=
//
www.wireless-meshup.org

Location
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
We are meeting at the c-base space station, 3 minutes from public transport=
 S
+U Jannowitzbr=C3=BCcke in the heart of Berlin.

