ns=20
and hacking, a seminar room for up to 15 for workshops, two spaces for a=20
smaller groups in the basement and upper floor and not at least the fully=20
equipped riverside with powersockets, light close to the grill station. For=
=20
the weekend we booked another room for presentations at European Theater=20
Institute right next door to the seminar room.

You will find yourself at Berlins most famous hackspace, where you can use=
=20
repair and assembling shops as well as meeting with berlins net activists a=
nd=20
hacker scene. freifunk.net is available, since the roof top node is part of=
=20
the BerlinBackBone.

