https://www.wireless-meshup.org/ and provide your meal prefernces and t-shi=
rt=20
size, in case you want one. Start preparing your presentation, lightening=20
talk, workshop, idea, announcement or open space you want to run. The event=
 is=20
*free of charge*, but contributions are very welcome, so please have a look=
 at=20
the supporters page as well, thanks in advance.

